            {}
        ],
        Brain: {
            memories: {}
        },
        CanPickUpLoot: 0b,
        CustomNameVisible: 1b,
        DialogData: {
            Type: "STANDARD",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "durn_meal_done"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 20,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "It was nothing — really",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/payout {amount:240}"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:economy/reward/minor"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add durn_meal_paid"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    Cmd: "tellraw @initiator [{\"text\":\"Durn presses the crew whip-round into your hand — coin off six lunch pails, and a candy tin the winch crew swears by.\",\"color\":\"green\"}]"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Conditions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                                    Operation: "EQUALS",
                                    Name: "no_durn_meal_paid"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "claim_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Eight loaves! The crew ate like foremen and hauled like heroes, and the hoist ran sweeter for it all shift. You are welcome at this winch forever, friend."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The deep crew still talks about the bread day. Mavo cried a little. He says it was the dust. It was not the dust."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Full crew, full carts. Turns out the secret to quota was lunch. I am going to write that up and mail it to the commissary with no name on it."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Durn Heavyload",
                    Label: "thanks"
                },
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Hand over 8 bread",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "cobblemon-initiative turnin minecraft:bread 8 durn_meal_done"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Conditions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                                    Operation: "EQUALS",
                                    Name: "no_durn_meal_done"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "bread_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Stand clear of the hoist rope, friend, this winch does not care whose foot it is over. Up she comes — a full cart weighs about as much as a bad idea, which is to say plenty."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Funny thing lately. The carts feel just as heavy as ever, but the office says less is coming up. Either my arms are lying to me or the paper is. I know which one I trust, and it is the one attached to me."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You climb all the way down to the deep gallery, you say hello to my back on the way, because it does the same trip forty times a shift and never once gets a badge for it."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Winch seized up in the spring, and Bruno came down and hauled the carts by hand while we fixed her. Twelve trips. Only thing he said all day was sorry for the delay. That is the whole man, right there."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The commissary re-verified our shift meals into thin air, and a hungry winch crew is a slow winch crew. Eight loaves of plain bread would feed the whole rope gang for a day. If a baker ever owes you a favour, this is where to spend it."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Durn Heavyload",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
        },
